arn, reflect on our history, and consider what it means to be Canadian.\n\nHistorica Canada's business number is 885434720RR0001\n\nAbout Us\nPolicies\nCareers\nHistorica Canada Content Usage Request Form\n\nFollow Us\nMore From Historica Canada\nCitizenship Challenge\nHeritage Minutes\nThe Memory Project\nThe Canadian Encyclopedia\nPartnership: The World Remembers\n© Historica Canada 2026. All rights reserved.\nWebsite by DS"
